{"id":"chatcmpl-ca997127-a89a-4d88-b782-2c0ad1801709","object":"chat.completion","created":1795249554,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"{\n  \"highlights\": \"When multiple vision-language models disagree on a medical image finding, the strategy is to query several independent models, compare their outputs, and use a verification step to audit conflicts before finalizing. The pattern emphasizes redundancy across tools and explicit conflict resolution rather than trusting a single model.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"Query multiple independent vision-language models on the same image question to obtain diverse assessments.\",\n    \"When tool outputs conflict, invoke a verification step that explicitly weighs the evidence and identifies which findings are consistent.\",\n    \"Use the majority or consistent positive findings across models to override a single negative result, especially when the positive findings specify anatomical details.\",\n    \"Frame tool queries to request both presence and laterality (left/right) to directly address the answer options.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical image interpretation\": \"Ask each model to describe the finding and its anatomical location; cross-check laterality across models.\",\n    \"Conflict resolution\": \"When models disagree, run a verification tool that summarizes the conflict and justifies the final answer based on consistency and specificity.\",\n    \"Multiple-choice visual QA\": \"Design queries that explicitly mention the answer options (e.g., left vs. right) to get directly comparable outputs.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm that at least two independent models agree on the finding and its laterality before finalizing.\",\n    \"Ensure the verification step explicitly addresses any conflicting outputs and explains why the chosen answer is more reliable.\"\n  ]\n}"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":666,"total_tokens":972,"completion_tokens":306,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":666},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":306}}}